  speakerName: APO LAKAY
  speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
  dialogueText: '"If you want someone to take the opposite direction, you can tell
    them to turn right.

    In Ilokano, ''agliko iti kannawan'' means ''turn right.''

    Listen
    carefully: agliko iti kannawan.

    Now, try saying ''agliko iti kannawan''
    yourself."

'
